  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development to which this permission relates must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of the decision notice. \rReason: To comply with the provisions of S.51 of the Planning & Compulsory Purchase Act 2004.\r",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the approved plans, \r\rLocation Plan\rBlock Plan 002\rGround and First Floor Plan 001  \r\rReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning.",
    "The use of the property as a House in Multiple Occupation hereby approved shall be occupied by a maximum of 5 people at any one time and shall not be subdivided or occupied as self-contained units. \r\rReason: To accord with the stipulations of definition as a House of Multiple Occupation and to safeguard the residential character of the surrounding area.\r",
    "Within 2 months form the date of this decision four covered and secured cycle parking spaces shall be provided in a safe and convenient location within the curtilage of the application site and shall be maintained as such thereafter.\r\rReason: To ensure the provision of cycle parking in line with the Council's adopted standards.\r",
    "Within 2 months from the date of this decision notice, refuse and waste storage and recycling facilities shall be provided within the curtilage of the application site as required by the standards of the Council.  Such facilities to be retained permanently thereafter. \r\rReason: To safeguard the amenity of the occupiers of adjoining premises; protect the general environment; prevent any obstruction to pedestrian movement and to ensure that there are adequate facilities for the storage and recycling of recoverable materials.\r"
  ],
